Changes build-collab.ts applies to omp's packages/collab-web before building the dashboard's page copy:
- keep the agents panel closed until you open it (upstream opens it when the first subagent appears)
- drop the Umami analytics script tag
- attach images to a prompt: picker button and paste, re-encoded as JPEG to fit one replicated entry (lib/images.ts)
- on a touch screen Enter types a newline; only the Send button sends
- guest name: a name typed on the connect screen, else the dashboard's ?name= (the Tailscale machine name), else "guest"
- theme from the dashboard's ?theme=; no theme toggle in the chat header
- mobile header: the chat name (live sessionName) on up to two lines in place of the omp mark; no leave button
- mobile header: the connection dot centered in its circle
- keep an encrypted copy of each chat on the device (IndexedDB, lib/transcript-cache.ts) and show it, marked "Saved copy", until the live snapshot arrives

